# "Destroy target creature, enchantment, or planeswalker": on turn 3 Bot2's only permanents are a Forest, a Mox Emerald and a
# Sol Ring (artifacts and a land), none of them a legal target, so Get Lost is not offered although Bot1 could pay {1}{W} with a
# Plains and Mox Pearl. After Bot2's Fastbond (an enchantment) arrives on turn 4, Get Lost is cast on it on turn 5: it is
# destroyed and its controller, Bot2, gets two Map tokens.

